OL,5,G0600 Teleshopping
OL,6,     FShopping from Home.
OL,7,G0900 999 Rescue Squad
OL,8,     FA car being pursued by police
OL,9,     Fcrashes and HART are called to
OL,10,     Ftreat a passenger trapped in her
OL,11,     Fseat with serious injuries.
OL,12,     FMeanwhile, floodwaters swamp a
OL,13,     FYorkshire town.
OL,14,G1000 999 Rescue Squad
OL,15,     FA horse rider is hit by a car on a
OL,16,     Fcountry road, leaving both her and
OL,17,     Fher horse with serious injuries.
OL,18,     FPlus, the centre of Leeds is
OL,19,     Flocked down after a suspicious
OL,20,     Fpackage is found.
